<!-- ******************************************************* Academics data ************************* -->

<category>
<pattern>BACHELORS PROGRAMMES</pattern>
<template>
 The Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech) program
         at our institution offers a four-year undergraduate engineering degree.
          We provide courses in various disciplines such as Computer Science, Mechanical,
          Electrical, Electronics, and Civil Engineering. Eligibility requires completion
          of high school with a focus on science and mathematics. Our curriculum includes theoretical
          studies, practical sessions, and industry projects. We offer modern facilities and industry
          partnerships for internships. Graduates have promising job prospects across multiple sectors.
          For more details, visit our website Link:https://www.sknscoe.ac.in/
</template>
</category>

<category>
<pattern>ELIGIBILITY BACHELORS</pattern>
<template>
  First Year Degree Bachelor of Engineering ln

1. Passed HSC or its equivalent examination with Physics and Mathematics as compulsory subjects ln
OR  ln
Passed Diploma in Engineering and Technology  ln

Direct Second  Year Bachelor of Engineering  ln

1. Passed Diploma Course in Engineering and Technology ln
OR ln
Passed B.Sc Degree from a University Grants Commission (UGC) or Association of Indian Universities recognized University. ln
Link:https://www.sknscoe.ac.in/
</template>
</category>

<category>
<pattern>MASTERS PROGRAMMES</pattern>
<template>
  The Master of Technology (M.Tech) program is a two-year postgraduate degree offered
  in various specializations such as Computer Science, Mechanical, Electrical, and Civil Engineering.
  Eligibility requires an undergraduate degree in engineering or related fields with a strong academic record.
  The program focuses on advanced coursework, research projects, and practical applications.
  Graduates have diverse career opportunities in industries, research institutions, and academia.
   For more details, visit our website Link:https://www.sknscoe.ac.in/
</template>
</category>

<category>
<pattern>ELIGIBILTY MASTERS</pattern>
<template>
  First Year Master of Engineering ln

1. Passed Bachelor Degree in the relevant field of Engineering and Technology from All India Council for Technical Education or Central or State Government approved Institutions or equivalent, with at least 50% marks (at least 45% marks in case of candidates of Reserved class categories and persons with disability belonging to Maharashtra State only); ln
2. Passed Bachelor Degree in the relevant course of Engineering and Technology as specified in the eligibility criteria for admission to a Post Graduate Degree course of the concerned University for which admission is being sought. ln
3. Obtained non zero positive score in Graduates Aptitude Test in Engineering (GATE) conducted by Indian Institute of Technology ln
Link:https://www.sknscoe.ac.in/
</template>
</category>

